## 2. Whitelist 3rd-party per use-case

### Sentry (error tracking)

```
script-src:   https://browser.sentry-cdn.com
connect-src:  https://sentry.io https://o*.ingest.sentry.io
```

### Google Analytics / Tag Manager

```
script-src:   https://www.googletagmanager.com https://www.google-analytics.com
img-src:      https://www.google-analytics.com https://stats.g.doubleclick.net
connect-src:  https://www.google-analytics.com https://stats.g.doubleclick.net
```

> UWAGA: GTM tworzy dynamiczne skrypty — wymaga `'strict-dynamic'` lub `'unsafe-inline'`.
> Preferuj nonce + strict-dynamic zamiast whitelist.

### Google Fonts

```
style-src:    https://fonts.googleapis.com
font-src:     https://fonts.gstatic.com
```

### Zewnętrzne obrazy (CDN)

```
img-src:   https://cdn.{{PROD_DOMAIN}} https://res.cloudinary.com
```

### DemoApp (minimalna konfiguracja — brak 3rd-party poza Sentry)

```
script-src:   'nonce-{NONCE}' 'strict-dynamic'
style-src:    'self' 'unsafe-inline'
img-src:      'self' data: blob:
connect-src:  'self' https://sentry.io https://o*.ingest.sentry.io
font-src:     'self' data:
```

